{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118816","id":3562609731,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7UWRxD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118816","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118816.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118816.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118816","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118816/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118816/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118816/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3c18b7e5ce3738bb74719069cc2bcb8d017138f6","number":118816,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix GPUParticles3D/CPUParticles3D shadows freezing when off-screen or in \"Shadows Only\" mode","user":{"login":"Mingxi-Z","id":100094557,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfdSXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100094557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Mingxi-Z","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes an issue where GPUParticles3D and CPUParticles3D would stop simulating when entirely outside the main camera frustum or set to \"Shadow Only\" mode, causing their cast shadows to appear frozen on screen.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n- **Positional Shadows (_render_scene)**: Add `particles_request_process()` calls to `_light_instance_update_shadow` to keep particles in Omni/Spot light shadows simulating off-screen.\r\n- **Directional & Shadows-Only (_scene_cull)**: Add `particles_request_process()` and `redraw_request()` during directional shadow cascade evaluation and within the `FLAG_CAST_SHADOWS_ONLY` culling loop.\r\n- **Billboard Particles**: Pass the main camera's view direction to off-screen particles to ensure that the orientation of billboard particles continues to update.\r\n\r\nFixes #77139 \r\nFixes #17267 \r\n\r\nFix: Shadows Only Mode\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55de24c2-0790-45d4-913a-872ee8bcc6be\r\n\r\n\r\nFix: Off-screen Particles\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02a2a1f6-4ebe-48d6-b9fd-f46a85bc0954\r\n\r\n### Was generative AI (LLM AI) used to create a portion of this PR?\r\n\r\nI used Codex and Gemini to research the relevant particle shadow functionalities, review my final code, and help me draft the PR description. The changes were mainly made by me, with AI assistance for clarity.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":